  "attorney": "Allyson G. O\u2019Malley-Jones, Leticia Camacho, and Eric Dunn (of Northwest Justice Project), for petitioners., Daniel T. Satterberg, Prosecuting Attorney, and Sarah Jackson, Thomas W. Kuffel, and David M. Seaver, Deputies, for respondent., Katherine George on behalf of Allied Newspapers of Washington, Washington Newspaper Publishers Association, and Washington Coalition for Open Government, amici curiae., Rory B. O\u2019Sullivan and Leona C. Bratz on behalf of King County Housing Justice Project and Snohomish County Housing Project, amici curiae., Victoria M. Slade and Robert B. Spitzer on behalf of Tenants Union of Washington State, amicus curiae., David J. Ward on behalf of Legal Voice, amicus curiae., Sarah A. Dunne, Nancy L. Talner, Douglas B. Blunder, and Vanessa Torres Hernandez on behalf of American Civil Liberties Union of Washington Foundation, amicus curiae., Grace S. Huang on behalf of Washington State Coalition Against Domestic Violence, amicus curiae.",
