        "timestamp": "2025-02-26T05:54:48.720853Z",
        "date_created": "2023-09-27T19:05:57.033090Z"
      },
      "ordering_key": 2,
      "per_curiam": false,
      "sha1": "",
      "snippet": "\nWIGGINS, J. (dissenting)\n\u00b6 39 Special sex offender sentencing alternative (SSOSA) evaluations contain \"health care information\" and that information is exempt from disclosure under the Public Records Act (PRA), chapter 42.56 RCW. In addition, the trial court did not err by allowing John Does G, I, and J (John Does) to proceed in pseudonym. For these reasons, I cannot join the majority's opinion and respectfully dissent.\n<p id=\"",
